tion metadata and sends cached plan on the same request","FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE-001 degraded begin keeps the turn cache.does not replace queryText queryTitle planFile todoId openedAt or audit counters","FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE P2 cache identity metadata and outcomes.retries primary submit for identical degraded fingerprint instead of only reusing failsafe","FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE P2 cache identity metadata and outcomes.round-trips hash and space failsafePath through object YAML and clears degraded after primary success"],"missingNativeNames":[],"relation":"executed-criterion-specific","state":"not-accepted"},{"requirementId":"FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE-001","acceptanceCriterionId":"FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE-001-AC002","acceptanceCriterion":"Prompt-hook status reports durable opened only after confirmed primary persistence; otherwise it reports opened-degraded and identifies the retained recovery artifact without representing the turn as server-persisted.","realCodeAssertion":"Assert opened is emitted only after exact durable readback; queued recovery emits opened-degraded and the retained absolute path.","concreteTestCount":4,"concreteTests":["FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE P2 cache identity metadata and outcomes.refuses beginTurn session rebind without durable proof and reports degraded recovery path","FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE P2 cache identity metadata and outcomes.emits recoveryArtifactPath for degraded duplicate Open-PluginTurn path","FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE P2 cache identity metadata and outcomes.retries primary submit for identical degraded fingerprint instead of only reusing failsafe","FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE P2 cache identity metadata and outcomes.round-trips hash and space failsafePath through object YAML and clears degraded after primary success"],"missingNativeNames":[],"relation":"executed-criterion-specific","state":"not-accepted"},{"requirementId":"FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE-001","acceptanceCriterionId":"FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE-001-AC003","acceptanceCriterion":"Complete recovers required query text from the cached query text, then a valid cached title, then the approved placeholder, without replacing a valid title; update omits empty query text so stored query text and title are preserved.","realCodeAssertion":"Assert query fallback order is cached query, valid cached title, placeholder; assert empty update query is omitted and valid title remains unchanged.","concreteTestCount":3,"concreteTests":["FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE-001 degraded begin keeps the turn cache.complete recovery uses cached queryText then queryTitle then the placeholder","FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE-001 degraded begin keeps the turn cache.update omits an empty queryText so the server value can stay","FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE P2 cache identity metadata and outcomes.omits an empty query through the real builder and shim"],"missingNativeNames":[],"relation":"planned-criterion-specific","state":"not-accepted"},{"requirementId":"FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE-001","acceptanceCriterionId":"FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE-001-AC004","acceptanceCriterion":"A missing-turn appendDialog on an already degraded local turn performs at most one bounded recovery submit and then retains a session_dialog failsafe; an unrelated never-degraded not-found remains a classified nonretryable error.","realCodeAssertion":"Assert an already-degraded missing turn performs exactly one recovery submit and retains session_dialog; never-degraded 404 is nonretryable and creates no failsafe.","concreteTestCount":1,"concreteTests":["FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE-001 degraded begin keeps the turn cache.degraded 404 queues a session_dialog failsafe and does not say failsafe not used"],"missingNativeNames":[],"relation":"executed-criterion-specific","state":"not-accepted"},{"requirementId":"FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE-001","acceptanceCriterionId":"FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE-001-AC005","acceptanceCriterion":"A same-request retry supplies preserved creation metadata, normalizes canceled and cancelled supersession consistently, and never silently converts locally active state into proof of server persistence.","realCodeAssertion":"Assert preserved metadata is sent, canceled/cancelled normalize identically, and local active state never sets persisted=true without server proof.","concreteTestCount":4,"concreteTests":["FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE P2 cache identity metadata and outcomes.stores canceled with exact None when a new request supersedes an open turn","FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE P2 cache identity metadata and outcomes.omits an empty query through the real builder and shim","FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE P2 cache identity metadata and outcomes.retries primary submit for identical degraded fingerprint instead of only reusing failsafe","FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE P2 cache identity metadata and outcomes.preserves degraded creation metadata and sends cached plan on the same request"],"missingNativeNames":[],"relation":"executed-criterion-specific","state":"not-accepted"},{"requirementId":"FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE-002","acceptanceCriterionId":"FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE-002-AC001","acceptanceCriterion":"First persistence resolves planFile and todoId using explicit request values, then verified cache values, then the exact sentinel None, and stores a non-null pair.","realCodeAssertion":"Assert planFile/todoId pair precedence and non-null persisted values for all three branches.","concreteTestCount":6,"concreteTests":["FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE P2 cache identity metadata and outcomes.rejects whitespace metadata on ordinary first persistence","FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE P2 cache identity metadata and outcomes.omits metadata on durable reopen unless the caller sends an explicit value","FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE P2 cache identity metadata and outcomes.sends exact None on updateTurn when caller clears planFile and todoId","FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE P2 cache identity metadata and outcomes.binds cached planFile and todoId on appendActions completeTurn and recovery submit","FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE P2 cache identity metadata and outcomes.HV10 durable update/append/complete omit planFile and todoId when caller omits them","FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE P2 cache identity metadata and outcome